2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Methods\040for\040realistic\040landscape\040imaging)
/Author (Forest\040Kenton\040Musgrave)
/Subject (There\040are\040five\040fundamental\040concerns\040in\040the\040synthesis\040of\040realistic\040imagery\040of\040fractal\040landscapes\072\040\0501\051\040convincing\040geometric\040models\040of\040terrain\073\040\0502\051\040efficient\040algorithms\040for\040rendering\040those\040potentially\055large\040terrain\040models\073\040\0503\051\040atmospheric\040effects\054\040or\040aerial\040perspective\054\040to\040provide\040a\040sense\040of\040scale\073\040\0504\051\040surface\040textures\040as\040models\040of\040natural\040phenomena\040such\040as\040clouds\054\040water\054\040rock\040strata\054\040and\040so\040forth\054\040to\040enhance\040visual\040detail\040in\040the\040image\040beyond\040what\040can\040be\040modelled\040geometrically\073\040and\040\0505\051\040a\040global\040context\040in\040which\040to\040situate\040the\040scenes\056\040Results\040in\040these\040five\040areas\040are\040presented\054\040and\040some\040aspects\040of\040the\040development\040of\040computer\040graphics\040as\040a\040new\040process\040and\040medium\040for\040the\040fine\040arts\040are\040discussed\056\040Heterogeneous\040terrain\040models\040are\040introduced\054\040and\040preliminary\040experiments\040in\040simulating\040fluvial\040erosion\040are\040presented\040to\040provide\040fractal\040drainage\040network\040features\056\040For\040imaging\040detailed\040terrain\040models\040we\040describe\040grid\040tracing\054\040a\040time\055\040and\040memory\055efficient\040algorithm\040for\040ray\040tracing\040height\040fields\056\040To\040obtain\040aerial\040perspective\040we\040develop\040geometric\040models\040of\040aerosol\040density\040distributions\040with\040efficient\040integration\040schemes\040for\040determining\040scattering\040and\040extinction\054\040and\040an\040efficient\040Rayleigh\040scattering\040approximation\056\040We\040also\040describe\040physically\055based\040models\040of\040the\040rainbow\040and\040mirage\056\040Proceduralism\040is\040an\040underlying\040theme\040of\040this\040work\073\040this\040is\040the\040practice\040of\040abstracting\040models\040of\040complex\040form\040and\040behaviors\040into\040relatively\040terse\040algorithms\054\040which\040are\040evaluated\040in\040a\040lazy\040fashion\056\040Procedural\040textures\040are\040developed\040as\040models\040of\040natural\040phenomena\040such\040as\040mountains\040and\040clouds\054\040culminating\040a\040procedural\040model\040of\040an\040Earth\055like\040planet\040which\040in\040the\040future\040may\040be\040explored\040interactively\040in\040a\040virtual\040reality\040setting\056)
/Keywords (02\040Jan\0401993\054\040Rendering\040\050computer\040graphics\051\054\040Terrain\054\040Procedural\040texture\054\040Ray\040tracing\040\050graphics\051\054\040Computer\040graphics\054\040Yale\040University)
>>
endobj
